  "notes": "Their demand (32) is framed by As-Sa'di. 34:9-14 carries As-Sa'di's reason «لردكم الحق», so Allah's will is not misread. 35: the tafsirs differ on who is meant (Nuh, or the Prophet ﷺ as an aside): no gloss names him and nothing is drawn; only the neutral «كل عليه وزره». Geometric for «إنما يأتيكم به الله إن شاء» and «إن كان الله يريد… هو ربكم»."
